<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.AttachToAvatarTemp(AttachPoint: number)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llAttachToAvatarTemp(integer AttachPoint);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Follows the same convention as <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlAttachToAvatar" target="_blank">llAttachToAvatar</a>, with the exception that the object will not create new inventory for the user, and will disappear on detach or disconnect. Also, this function can be used on avatars other than the owner (if granted permission) in which case the ownership is changed to the new wearer.</p>
</p>
