          <td>AttachPoint / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/attach_point" target="_blank">attach_point</a></td>
          <td>ATTACH_* constant or valid value (see the tables below)</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

